  "description": "The proposal is for an extension to the 1st floor over the existing ground floor side extension with a  pitched roof height matching the height of the front bay and a small flat roof area on top. Front and rear elevations of the extension to have single door openings at the ground floor (solid door in timber at the front to the Utility and glazed door at the back to Pantry/Kitchen). First floor smaller windows to the front and rear elevations are proposed to serve En-suites. The extension is proposed to be set back by 0.5m from the line of the front elevation of the existing building and by 0.25m back from the rear elevation.\n",
